Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re finally drifting off to\Nsleep
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.96,0:00:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,when your brain suddenly goes,\N“Hey…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.80,0:00:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,remember that unbelievably awkward\Nthing you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.25,0:00:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,said five years ago?”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.06,0:00:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,During the day, your attention is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.44,0:00:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,busy with messages, work, people,\Nnoise—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.70,0:00:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,basically anything outside your\Nown head.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.64,0:00:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But at night, most of that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.15,0:00:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,disappears.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.08,0:00:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And when the room gets quiet,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.64,0:00:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,old memories can feel strangely\Nloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.34,0:00:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you start replaying the\Nmoment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.46,0:00:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.80,0:00:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What they probably thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.62,0:00:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What you should have said instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.12,0:00:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And because you’re tired, it can
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.27,0:00:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,be harder to pull your attention
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.43,0:00:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,away once the loop starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.22,0:00:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The strange part is, that memory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.30,0:00:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,usually isn’t more important at\Nmidnight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.38,0:00:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,than it was at noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.12,0:00:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It just has less competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.58,0:00:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So when your brain opens the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.49,0:00:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,midnight embarrassment archive,\Nremember:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.10,0:01:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,the memory didn’t get bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.02,0:01:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything around it just got\Nquieter.
